// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TrainerClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3341696317" "Trainers"
// DetailString :
"P416677389" "Trainers are capable of helping your character grow stronger. Whenever you gain enough experience to Level Up, a flashing arrow will appear near your Experience Bar. When you see this arrow, speak with a Trainer!<br><br>Depending on your character's level, Trainers can allow you to learn new Powers, or can help you add Enhancement Slots to Powers you already have.<br><br>Visiting Trainers every time you Level Up is an essential part of your character's growth - remember to train whenever you get the chance!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TravelClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3119198144" "Monorail Stations"
// DetailString :
"P2828904949" "The Paragon City Monorail is the best method for Heroes to move about Paragon City. Each Monorail station leads to every other City Zone that also has a station. Note that some zones, like Hazard Zones, don't have a Monorail station. In order to reach those zones, you'll need to find a connecting zone and travel there manually."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DayJobClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1063790510" "Day Job Locations"
// DetailString :
"P3206785513" "Day Job Locations are places where you can receive bonuses based on the amount of time your character spends offline. If you log off in a Day Job Location, you will begin to accrue a Day Job Bonus associated with that location. Each Day Job Bonus only lasts a limited amount of time, based on how long your character was offline in the related Day Job Location.<br><br>Below are some example Day Jobs:<br><br><b>City Hall</b>: Grants an Influence bonus for each completed mission.<br><br><b>Hospital</b>: Grants an out-of-combat Regeneration bonus.<br><br><b>Police Station</b>: Grants an Experience bonus for each completed mission.<br><br><b>Consignment House</b>: Grants a Temporary Power that allows you to teleport to Wentworth's Fine Consignments<br><br><b>Architect Entertainment</b>:  Grants bonus Architect Tickets for each completed Mission Architect mission."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SinclairClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3955513597" "Suspicious Simulation"
// DetailString :
"P267049836" "Someone recently ran a simulation in the Architect Entertainment building entitled 'Operation: Kidnap Sinclair'. You need to find out who this 'Sinclair' person is, and quickly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - ShiningStarsActIClueSouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2165124885" "Manticore's Arrow"
// tDetailString :
"P5112248" "You kept this arrow, engraved with the letter 'S', to remember your experiences with a ragtag group of heroes called...<br><br><color gold>The Shining Stars - A New Day Dawning</color><br><br>You were invited to join with a group of up-and-coming heroes that call themselves the Shining Stars.  After Twinshot introduced you to Proton, Flambeaux, and Dillo, everyone was surprised by an unexpected guest, Grym.  Having prevented an inexplicable ambush by Arachnos agents, the Shining Stars counted two new members to the group.<br><br>Twinshot then directed you to a friend of hers, Miss Liberty.  After pointing out that trainers were for novice and experienced heroes alike, Miss Liberty sent you via the city tram to speak with Blue Steel in Kings Row.  You did your part in helping Paragon City by assisting him in the arrest of a group of thugs calling themselves The Skulls.<br><br>Later, the Shining Star's makeshift hangout was attacked by Arachnos agents.  Fortunately, several of your friends were already at home when the assault came.  Working together, you were able to fend off the attacks of the servants of Lord Recluse.<br><br>All of your friends then hit the streets of Paragon City in hopes of locating the source of the Arachnos attacks.  Working together, the Shining Stars were able to track down where they were coming from.  After putting all the clues together, you believed that the Arachnos agents were mistakenly targeting you and your friends.  Their true target was Manticore, one of the greatest defenders of Paragon City!<br><br>After rushing to Manticore's mansion on the outskirts of the city, it appeared to be too late!  Arachnos agents had already broken into his home and claimed to have kidnapped him.  After fighting your way down to his secret lair beneath the mansion, you would learn that this was all nothing more than a test put together by Manticore himself!<br><br>Due to your help, the Shining Stars have been 'adopted' by Manticore and can now consider themselves to be a full-fledged supergroup!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - SecurityTerminal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3083536739" "<color orange>This looks like the security terminal Twinshot told you to use when you showed up.  Large flashing words indicate that you should choose one of the buttons below the screen.</color><br><br><color red>Notification: You are on private property.  Identify yourself at once!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P1132204274" "My name is {HeroName}.  Twinshot sent me."
// Answer Text :
"P1052909557" "I'd prefer to keep my identity secret, thank you."
// Answer Text :
"P488854337" "My name is Inigo Mon--"
// Page RealName Text :
"P1838044516" "<color orange>Words begin streaming across the display.</color><br><br>...Searching...<br>...Searching...<br>...Searching...<br><br>IMPOSTER!  REAL IDENTITY: Arachnos Infiltration Agent.<br><br>Initiating self-destruct sequence in t-minus five seconds and counting..."
// Answer Text :
"P1180662886" "Wait!  I'm not from Arachnos! I swear I'm really {HeroName}!"
// Page HiddenName Text :
"P4264014381" "<color orange>Words begin streaming across the display.</color><br><br>Unknown entities are to be terminated on sight!<br><br>Initiating self-destruct sequence in t-minus five seconds."
// Answer Text :
"P1440858948" "Hold on!  Twinshot knows who I am!"
// Page FakeName Text :
"P726946538" "<color orange>Words begin streaming across the display.</color><br><br>Seriously?  You went there?  C'mon... That joke is, like, over twenty years old.<br><br>Just for that, this terminal will self-destruct in 5 seconds."
// Answer Text :
"P3865418642" "You're kidding.  Tell me you're kidding!"
// Page SelfDestructFive Text :
"P2557374903" "...FIVE..."
// Answer Text :
"P2736198918" "Is this for real?"
// Page SelfDestructFour Text :
"P2951380401" "...FOUR..."
// Answer Text :
"P1819322970" "But you can't just--"
// Page SelfDestructTwo Text :
"P4073151632" "...TWO..."
// Answer Text :
"P3402083899" "Hey, wait a second!  You forgot three!!!"
// Page SelfDestructOne Text :
"P950902317" "ONE!!!!!!!!!"
// Answer Text :
"P2597621355" "[Step away from the terminal]"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - TwinshotOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3889958293" "Had you going, eh?  You should have seen your face.<br><br>At least you didn't try to blow up the terminal the way that Flambeaux did when I pulled that trick on her."
// Answer Text :
"P746490261" "What was that all about?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1210395013" "It's something I do to all the new guys.  Keeps 'em on their toes.  So, even though I think you're cool, my buddies might think you're a square, you know?<br><br>Now, I've already put in a good word for you, so this should be easy.  Let's go introduce you to them."
// Answer Text :
"P287255925" "Sounds good to me.  Who's first?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3616383143" "Let's go chat it up with Proton.  This is his place we're hanging out in, so I figure he'd want to meet the person who's tromping around the place, you know?  He should be around here somewhere.<br><br>Oh yeah, up on the second floor.  Down the hallway and up the elevators.  I'll let you lead the way so you can get a good feel of the place."
// Answer Text :
"P4171483521" "Indeed."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ProtonOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3635619643" "Hello.  Let me introduce myself.  I am Proton, and I welcome you here into my lab.  It may not be much, but considering my unusual circumstances, it was the best I could cobble together on short notice."
// Answer Text :
"P1089125166" "Unusual circumstances?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1388750113" "Oh, that's a long story, and one that I'll be happy to share once we get to know each other a little better.<br><br>Although I am looking forward to that time, currently I'm in the midst of running some very important analyses of recent data I've collected.  And I need every moment I can get that affords me peace and quiet."
// Answer Text :
"P302475077" "I apologize for disturbing you."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P3812215927" "Oh, no!  I didn't mean to imply that you were the one disturbing ---<br><br><color orange>Proton looks towards the direction of the new guest with a look of disappointment on his face...</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3770478256" "I take it this is the person?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P925730559" "Oh darn...  Well, it would seem that my experiment will need to be concluded later."
// Answer Text :
"P3490386127" "Ah... then it is her."
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P3261129811" "Ah, Flambeaux, my dear...<br><br>Well, yes.  I am doing the science again.  A lot of science, actually.  One could say I'm doing, oh, tons and tons of the science."
// Answer Text :
"P1805656320" "Perhaps I should let you get back to work?"
// Page InformationPage5 Text :
"P134093942" "No no, that's quite alright.  I'm quite certain that I'll be unable to get any work done for, unfortunately, a very good while.  However, I do thank you for your kindness, friend.  Not everyone is so understanding.<br><br><color orange>Proton looks to Flambeaux with a polite smile on his face.</color><br><br>Flambeaux, have you met our new friend, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P962139645" "I'll talk with her so you can get back to work."
// Page InformationPage6 Text :
"P743369672" "<color orange>You turn and talk with Flambeaux."
// Answer Text :
"P3898145311" "Close"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - FlambeauxOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P204997507" "Hey there.  The name's Flambeaux, because I'm hot.  Like, hot because of fire, right?  And also because, well, I'm hot."
// Answer Text :
"P1155702240" "Oh... Well... Uh... I see..."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P88226516" "Don't listen to her - she's just jealous.  I keep trying to tell her that the brooding emo look is sooo last year."
// Answer Text :
"P986408316" "That's... Interesting, I think."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1590222999" "What?  Where are you going, Proton?!<br><br>Great.  Way to go, Twin.  You just scared him away with your tough-guy look again."
// Answer Text :
"P1425417820" "Um..."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P678642055" "So... I bet you have a lot of questions about me, don't you?  Don't worry, it's natural - most people do.  Well, where do I begin... Okay, so, like, I came here to Paragon City because I felt people needed a hero, right?  And I knew that I'm so totally a hero, okay? So then -"
// Answer Text :
"P2925303765" "Um... Twinshot?"
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P601977756" "But I was just getting to - FINE!  I guess that little pipsqueak is more important than hearing about how I can make fire like totally shoot from my hands.<br><br>Well, I'm coming along, too!"
// Answer Text :
"P2148908790" "Let's go find Dillo."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DilloOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4264407646" "*hoorb*You are the friendly earthling that says {HeroName}!  Correct, correct, yes?!<br><br>*hoorb*<br><br>Dillo makes air sounds at you in greeting!"
// Answer Text :
"P2277432539" "I... Uh... Air sounds?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1023102558" "Correct, correct! *hoorb* I am making air sounds like an Earthling so we can be friends!  You are for friends with me, correct, correct?"
// Answer Text :
"P2367521646" "I... Um... Think the answer is yes?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P2902704884" "Jubilations and - how does the Earthlings say - the hot dogs!  I can not make air sounds to say my energy sign - oh, Earthlings say 'name' - but my friends say that I am Dillo.  You can bellow air and say Dillo to me, too.  I will say {HeroName} to you and we will be happy!  Correct, correct!"
// Answer Text :
"P880314855" "Um, is he saying we're friends now?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P618041402" "*hoorb* I am from a world that is not Earth.  And I come to warn the Earthlings of dangers.<br><br>The Proton and the Twinshot say it is too late because Shivans moved faster than me.<br><br>So now I stay and annihilate Shivans and end all existence of life signs of Shivan peoples!<br><br>*hoorb*<br><br>For Earth!"
// Answer Text :
"P2043369737" "You're here to help us with the Shivans?"
// Page InformationPage4 Text :
"P3631272531" "Correct, correct! We own encounters with Shivans where annihilation was given as our gift.<br><br><color orange>Dillo momentarily turns his attention to Twinshot.</color><br><br>*hoorb* We will make sounds at you in future times, the Twinshot.<br><br><color orange>Dillo resumes speaking with you.</color><br><br>So my sounds are being made to say that we now find other life-clusters and give warnings to them.  And I chose Earthling clusters!"
// Answer Text :
"P3941770686" "Your people were destroyed?"
// Page InformationPage5 Text :
"P439796599" "Not all my people.  Only in your counting of ten and eight of my planets were removed.  My people still have three left."
// Answer Text :
"P2937661977" "Oh, that's horrible!"
// Page InformationPage6 Text :
"P1660855546" "*hoorb*The Flambeaux wants to make air sounds about her person!  We like to listen to her, since she makes many, many air sounds!  Let us open the breath-holes and listen to her air sounds, correct, correct?"
// Answer Text :
"P2588454135" "Actually, I think your story is more -"
// Page InformationPage7 Text :
"P1552199341" "<color orange>The conversation pauses as Twinshot comes over the intercom.<br><br>Dillo appears to swell up and you feel a slight vibration in your teeth for no explicable reason.</color><br><br>The Twinshot requests assistance!  We must go!"
// Answer Text :
"P913773365" "I'm right with you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - GrymOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P682896397" "I am Grym, and I come from another land.  I wish to join your group so that I may guard over your safety."
// Answer Text :
"P2516132737" "Why do you want do that?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4184609663" "I have been chosen to bear the honor of protecting this city. I see that you are unable to defend yourself from the spider lords."
// Answer Text :
"P300668593" "Well, I guess there is that.  How do we know we can trust you?"
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1609754196" "By tracing the silver cord of my aura  -- Ah, yes... You possess inferi - different - senses than I do.  Then you will need to use your own judgement."
// Answer Text :
"P4277878118" "Well, I guess..."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1422617828" "Then it is settled.  I shall choose a small area nearby and make a den."
// Answer Text :
"P2821837755" "Okay..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - TwinshotTwo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P669652674" "Well, turns out it was a bit more exciting than I had originally planned.  So whaddya think?  Do we seem like people you'll want to hang with?"
// Answer Text :
"P2862128163" "Sure, I'll think about it."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4100928125" "Okay, same here.  I need to chat with the guys and see what they think about you."
// Answer Text :
"P1202236739" "That seems fair."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1225876611" "Why don't you meet me back in Atlas in a few and I'll let you know what they had to say."
// Answer Text :
"P4203591568" "See you there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3329776307" "Hey there, kid.  The name's Twinshot, but you can just call me Twinshot.  Your name has been floating around out there for a bit now and I'm hearing good things.  I figure that maybe you might want to hang out at the cool kid's table.  So I'm gonna go head over to where me and my buddies are hanging out and let them all know you're coming on over.  Sound good?"
// AcceptString :
"P25736231" "Yeah, I'll hang out with you guys."
// SendOffString :
"P2574959353" "Cool, cool.  So here's the addy where you can find us and the door code to get in.  Stop by whenever and I'll introduce you to all the rest."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3332201929" "Meet the Gang!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3193878075" "You have an open invitation to hang out with the coolest people in Paragon City, {HeroName}.  What are you waiting for?"
