// Task - Mission4_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1613462451" "Find Flambeaux at the Consignment House"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1179149896" "Flambeaux should be over by the Consignment House.  A big shock of red, remember?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2518831406" "You talked with Flambeaux and she showed you an odd object she found while buying some enhancements. She said she found it over nearby the AE building."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1230638850" "Go to the AE Building."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3776238046" "You found a clue, you say? Well shift your gears and go find some more evidence."
// VolumeDescription :
"P1003199778" "Travel to the AE Building"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2038669223" "You found an odd clue around the AE building:  It would seem like a simulation routine was being used by a number of participants shortly before the raid on your base, titled 'Operation: Kidnap Sinclair'.  All you need to do is track down who this 'Sinclair' is."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1953467329" "Sinclair? Are you serious? Do you even know who Justin Sinclair is?<br><br>Oh boy... This just got big."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ManticoreOne 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3845647052" "So... You managed to get here even before my guys reported back to me."
// Answer Text :
"P2018572543" "Your guys?  The Arachnos agents?"
// Page ConvoNode1 Text :
"P2815557282" "Yes, the Arachnos agents.  Is there something wrong with me controlling Arachnos agents?"
// Answer Text :
"P113442792" "Well... yes, I'm afraid there is."
// Page SecondFloor Text :
"P2761400563" "Good answer.  Then I guess it's a good thing they're not working for Arachnos.  Or ever have.<br><br>They're all friends of mine posing as agents.  In other words, they're on our team."
// Answer Text :
"P609473524" "But why would --"
// Page ThirdFloor Text :
"P2418940570" "Why would they dress up like Arachnos agents?  To see if your ragtag band of friends really has what it takes to be crimefighters.  And I'll say... I'm impressed.<br><br>I've set everything up from the moment you joined them.  I had to see what you would do, all the way at the very end when you were promised riches and the like.  Let's just say that if I had a chocolate factory, I would be handing it over right about now."
// Answer Text :
"P2504596554" "I'm not following..."
// Page LockDown Text :
"P3938279671" "What I'm getting at is that I'm going to sponsor your team of heroes.  From here on you're not going to be hanging around inside some old abandoned lab.  You're going to get a better base, better support, and the best thing?  You get to have me breathing over your shoulders the whole time.  This job isn't easy, but I think you all can do it.  From here on, count me as one of your members.  Now go tell your friends."
// Answer Text :
"P2957678917" "Alright then! I'll do just that."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4277484552" "I can't believe this.  These arrows you found next to the Arachnos costumes bear the logo of the Sinclair family crest.  Sinclair as in Justin Sinclair.  Also known as Manticore.  This can only mean that Manticore has been kidnapped by Arachnos!<br><br>We have to save him!"
// AcceptString :
"P869490176" "I'll save Manticore!"
// SendOffString :
"P245116180" "I know where the guy lives.  I'll take you to his mansion.  You're going to need to find and rescue him!<br><br>In the meantime, I'll try to contact the Freedom Phalanx, the group he's part of.  Good luck, {HeroName}."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2633915744" "Rescue Manticore!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3584643157" "Look, kid, if Manticore's in trouble this is big.  But we can't waste another minute!  We need to get to him now or who knows what will happen to him?"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P64818684" "<color deepskyblue>The Lion's Den</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P3954858546" "Manticore's Mansion"
// EntryString :
"P4213334025" "There doesn't seem to be any sign of damage to his house, which is odd.  You can investigate that later, though.  For now, find Manticore and rescue him!"

